      ],
      "finding": "v4.0.4 retains approximate, moderate and strict predicates alongside the higher-precedence ID predicate. The changelog documents the ID support addition. Exclusive replacement or silence is not established. The recommendation can still rest on the explicitly bounded workspace/recovery gaps.",
      "needed_revision": "Describe ID support as an added alignment predicate and leave exact fallback conditions unresolved unless read."
